# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
.DS_Store
dist
dist-ssr
coverage
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Wrangler local secrets (worker vars for `wrangler dev`).
# The `.example` template is the one file here that must stay tracked — it is the
# only record of which vars a fresh clone needs, and `.dev.vars.*` would swallow it.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example

# Wrangler/miniflare local state: a sqlite cache plus per-run build bundles.
# Regenerated on every `wrangler dev`, so committing it only creates diff noise.
.wrangler/

# Crash dumps (Cygwin/Git-Bash drops these in the cwd)
*.stackdump

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

*.tsbuildinfo

.eslintcache

# Cypress
/cypress/videos/
/cypress/screenshots/

# Vitest
__screenshots__/

# Vite
*.timestamp-*-*.mjs

# Claude Code
CLAUDE.md
